If you want to use this webscraper on Walmart or Kroger all you need to do is
    1. Go to their main webpage
    2. Search for whatever you are looking for (eggs, bread, chicken, etc)
    3. Right click on the page
    4. Click on view page source
    5. Copy the entire html file located there
    6. Put that html file into an html file on your computer
    7. Update the html Directory in parse.py
    8. Run the code!